From 75c7443bd210fdfa5d8e1a79904fef58ad333c6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yiyu Zhou <yiyu@yiyuzhou.io>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 02:49:10 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 42/47] workflows: install upstream nix in the galago build

DeterminateSystems/nix-installer-action downloads the latest Determinate
Nix Installer at run time, even when the action itself is pinned, and by
default it installs Determinate Nix, logs in to FlakeHub, and sends
diagnostics to Determinate Systems.  This job holds CACHIX_AUTH_TOKEN,
so what it runs should change only with a commit here.  Install
upstream Nix with cachix/install-nix-action instead, as check.yml does,
which fixes the version of Nix through the commit that it is pinned to.

The machines run Lix, so neither installer matches them, and derivations
do not depend on the installer.  Builds still run under /nix/build, the
volume that nothing-but-nix makes, as they did with Determinate Nix.
---
 .github/workflows/build-galago.yml | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/build-galago.yml b/.github/workflows/build-galago.yml
index 42f0d9f..fdfb073 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/build-galago.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/build-galago.yml
@@ -44,9 +44,9 @@ jobs:
     steps:
       - uses: actions/checkout@main
       - uses: wimpysworld/nothing-but-nix@main
-      - uses: DeterminateSystems/nix-installer-action@main
+      - uses: cachix/install-nix-action@382a9ed9481c7c1f94f68b72ef105b3417c73877 # v32.1.0
         with:
-          extra-conf: |
+          extra_nix_config: |
             # Substitute from the caches that the nixConfig of flake.nix names
             accept-flake-config = true
             build-dir = /nix/build
-- 
